        "descriptions": [
          {
            "lang": "en",
            "value": "The Open eClass platform (formerly known as GUnet eClass) is a complete course management system. Prior to version 4.2, a Stored Cross-Site Scripting (XSS) vulnerability allows authenticated high-privileged users (teachers or administrators) to inject malicious JavaScript into multiple user-controllable input fields across the application, which is executed when other users access affected pages. This issue has been patched in version 4.2."
          }
        ],
        "source": {
          "advisory": "GHSA-2x83-4fh2-fcw7",
          "discovery": "UNKNOWN"
